    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akiruja a Nebukadinesar ŋina a ŋaarei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae nu ŋakiro ŋuna abu erwosit Nebukadinesar keserau neni a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ: Neni a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ, neni a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ ka neni daadaŋ a ŋulu irworosi ŋaŋajepa ŋuna egelegelya a ŋulu iboiyete anakwap a daadaŋ. Abu iŋes tema, “Elipi toryamut iyes ebari ŋolo alalan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae alakara kaŋ alimokin iyes ŋakitoodyanakineta ka ŋaumonokineta ŋuna adau Akuj ŋina alokidiama nooi akitiya aŋuna kaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eboi ayoŋ emam ŋace alore kaŋ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Ani aperi ayoŋ alokitaada kaŋ, ŋuna abu ayoŋ eŋolik anakiruja ikes nu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Abu ayoŋ orubak ete ŋuna erujae aperi alokitaada kaŋ, abu ayoŋ eŋolik emalaika, esubuna ŋolo anakuj, ebunit anakuj.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu emalaika ŋol tocelu tema,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu erwosit Nebukadinesar tema, “Ŋakiro ŋuna abu ayoŋ oanyu anakiruja ikes ŋun. Tokona Belitesasar, tolimokinae ayoŋ apolou kec, anerae mam ipei daŋ alokidiŋ ŋikaosok a apukan kaŋ ŋini abu topedo alimokin ayoŋ, nai ipedori iyoŋ alimokin ayoŋ apolou a akiruja a ŋin, anerae eyai etau a ŋakujo a ŋuna asegak neni kon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kisileereu Daniel apolou a akiruja a ŋina a ŋaarei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Daniel ŋolo arae ekiro keŋ ece Belitesasar tosiliyo adiouriyen ebulit nooi, apotu ŋatameta keŋ kitubulo iŋes. Tema nai erwosit neni keŋ, “Belitesasar, nyimyek ŋakiro ŋuna ka akiruja a ŋin, kori apolou kec ikitubulo iyoŋ.” Toboŋok Belitesasar tema, “Ekapolon kaŋ, kerae ca topedonor, keruwor ŋakiro ŋuna irujat iyoŋ ŋuna a ŋulu ikimanito iyoŋ ka keruwor apolou kec ŋina a ŋimoe kon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitoe ŋolo ibu iyoŋ kiŋolik, ekitoe ŋolo abu topolou ka togogoŋior, ŋolo abu akou keŋ todol kidiama, ŋolo eteo anakwap a daadaŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekitoe ŋolo ebusak ŋakwii keŋ ka alalak ŋaraito keŋ nooi, ekitoe ŋolo abu kiteryamu daadaŋ akimuj, ekitoe ŋolo apotu ŋityaŋ ŋulu ka ariet kiboiyoto, ŋolo apotu ŋikyeny toduko ŋakais kec naten keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoe erwosit, iyoŋ ekitoe ŋol! Ipoloor iyoŋ ka igogoŋior, eyatakin apolou kon adol kidiama ka abu apukan kon kiryam akwap daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina iteo iyoŋ erwosit kaŋ emalaika ŋol ŋolo asegan ebunit anakuj ebala, “Toyepakisi ekitoe ŋol kwap ka tomunaasi iŋes, nai kimyekisi apuŋure ka ŋataagor edupakina kwap eenen ka asuwat ka eburonis, eyakasi lonya ŋulu ka ariet. Kimyekisi iŋes kitopalala ŋakopi ŋuna alokidiama kimyekisi iŋes kiboiyoto ka ŋityaŋ ŋulu ka ariet, emaikina iŋes torubak ikoni nen ŋikaru ŋikanikaarei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apolou a ŋakiro a ŋun iŋes na, okoe erwosit: Erae atubokinet a Akuj a ŋina alokidiama nooi iŋes abu neni a ekapolon kaŋ a erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiritaryo iyoŋ alotuŋa a ŋuluce, eruwor neni iboiyoto ŋityaŋ ŋulu ka ariet iboiyo iyoŋ. Inyami iyoŋ ŋinya ikwa enyamyata ŋaatuk, ikitopalalete iyoŋ ŋakopi ŋuna alokidiama, irubakini iyoŋ ikoni nen ŋikaru ŋikanikaarei akitodol ŋina iyenunia iyoŋ atemar Akuj ŋina alokidiama nooi iŋes ipukat ŋakwapin ŋuna ipukato ŋituŋa ka einakini iŋes apukan neni a ŋini ecamit iŋes ainakin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikwapei alimunitere atemar kimyekinae apuŋure ka ŋataagor a ekitoe, apolou keŋ atemar iruwor iyoŋ erwosit nabo apaki ŋina icamunia iyoŋ atemar Akuj iŋes ipukat akwap daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, okoe erwosit, kiwuap ŋuna akalimok ayoŋ iyoŋ; toŋer ŋasecisya kon, kitiya ŋuna iyookino ka toŋer aronis kon, kitiya irimaana aneni a ŋulu iteryamunitae ŋican. Ani kitiya iyoŋ ŋun, acepaki irubakini iyoŋ itiyae ŋinibore ejok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akitiditeuno bon a Nebukadinesar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋakiro ŋun daadaŋ kitiyakinos neni a erwosit Nebukadinesar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelunyarosi ŋilapyo ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, apaki ŋina alosyo erwosit alokidiama akai ŋina ka apukan alo Babilon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu erwosit tema, “Meere mono etaun a Babilon ŋoloti apolon lo a? Etaun ŋolo adau ayoŋ adukokin erae neni iboiyo erwosit, ŋolo adau ayoŋ adukokin a apedor kaŋ aŋuna ka akitoodiunia apolou kaŋ ŋina ailiilon a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eriŋa erwosit irworo, bu etoil alokidiama ebala, “Okoe erwosit Nebukadinesar alimun nu aŋuna kon: Alemar apukan aneni kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiritaryo iyoŋ alotuŋa a ŋuluce, eruwor neni iboiyoto ŋityaŋ ŋulu ka ariet iboiyo iyoŋ, inyami iyoŋ ŋinya ikwa enyamyata ŋaatuk, irubakini iyoŋ ikoni nen ŋikaru ŋikanikaarei, akitodol ŋina iyenunia iyoŋ atemar Akuj ŋina alokidiama nooi iŋes ipukat ŋakwapin ŋuna ipukato ŋituŋa, einakini iŋes apukan neni a ŋini ecamit iŋes ainakin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iyookin ŋakiro ŋun atipei aneni a Nebukadinesar, aponi kiritarae iŋes alotuŋa a ŋuluce, abu tonyam ŋinya ikwa ŋaatuk, apotu ŋakopi ŋuna alokidiama kitopalala akuwan keŋ akitodol ŋina aoyakuniata ŋitim keŋ tobiut ŋakopir a egole, kikwaanikinos ŋimeeger keŋ ka ŋimoyo a ŋikyeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipur Nebukadinesar Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
